# Play test of Cormorant Skerry (CIPlay cormorant_skerry, in a test world 'CI ...'). No quest: the upturned boat and the
# crate by it, the nests on the top, the treasure. Points as in its recipe.
island Cormorant Skerry
offset 0 0
wait 3
at 4 -6
expect height 2
open Crate by the boat
at -4 5 h=5.5
expect height 5.5
dig
